    {
      "id": "claim_b610208c7da345fca0788548de2d0067",
      "statement": "When multiple DesignDBs are detected, the user can manually select which ones to use. The configuration remembers which DBs it was opened with (stored in db_filenames as JSON). All selected DBs are parsed and merged into a single logical DesignDB view during importFiles.",
