      "id": "claim_704681e5531d48ca9cbd8f77092c46fd",
      "statement": "FolderSetupScreen.handleOpenSaved must call requestFolderAccess before any other await. Chrome only honours a permission request inside the user gesture that triggered it, and any earlier await ends that gesture.",
