      "id": "claim_07493bebeb5a42c28906ad98f87c7fa5",
      "statement": "Each project has an independent SQLite configuration scoped by project_id: separate tag rules and palettes, template libraries (both global and project-scoped), position tags and ignore flags, slot mappings, collections, unexported changes, and locally-created element types.",
