      "id": "claim_942b81a9af9d46378e8fd55bac8dfd42",
      "statement": "Configuration backup (YAML) exports only configuration (tags, templates, slot mappings, collections, metadata) via exportConfigYAML, never work in progress (unexported changes, form captures, import draft). On restore, it is merged into the configuration so nothing is overwritten unexpectedly.",
