    {
      "id": "claim_1ffbc7655e8443e8ae78251e1f3ff51c",
      "statement": "duplicateGroups detects project rows that point to the same physical folder via isSameEntry. When duplicates are found, the user is offered to merge: the canonical row (with the most work) is kept and strays are either deleted (if empty) or re-keyed onto the canonical folder as new config names. Overlay data never merges.",
