    {
      "id": "claim_cfffae6d21f647a4977afbd407d897ba",
      "statement": "adoptPlan(canonical, strays) determines how to collapse duplicate project rows: empty strays are deleted, strays holding work are re-keyed onto a free config name of the canonical folder. This preserves all work and enforces the UNIQUE(folder_path, config_name) constraint.",
