    {
      "id": "claim_6f2cc66224e04dfa8c66ce93cf9307da",
      "statement": "Configuration sync with an optional companion is decomposed into items (position tags, templates, slot mappings, collections, preferences). Pull applies newer remote items (except those changed locally). Push sends only items that differ from the last synced snapshot. The mechanism is silent and never touches unexported changes.",
