    {
      "id": "claim_9225ff333f93460db9a11bf45e8b0c63",
      "statement": "openProject orchestrates the full open sequence: upserts the project row, applies any restore data, parses the workbooks, pulls the project's configuration from the companion, reads every saved preference and tag rule, computes effective tags and tag drift, and loads everything into the Redux store.",
